import {useEffect,useState}from"react";import{getVendorPrintoutRequests,updatePrintoutStatus}from"../../api/printoutApi";export default function PrintoutRequests(){const[data,setData]=useState([]),load=()=>getVendorPrintoutRequests().then(r=>setData(r.data?.data||[]));useEffect(()=>{load();},[]);const update=async(id,status)=>{await updatePrintoutStatus(id,{status});load()};return <div className="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-8"><p className="eyebrow">VENDOR WORKSPACE</p><h1 className="page-title">Printout requests</h1><div className="mt-6 space-y-4">{data.map(x=><div className="card p-5" key={x.id}><div className="flex flex-wrap justify-between gap-2"><b>{x.requestNumber} · {x.documentName}</b><span className="badge">{x.status}</span></div><p className="mt-2 text-sm">{x.printMode} · {x.pageCount} pages · {x.copies} copies · {x.fulfilmentType} · ₹{x.totalAmount}</p><div className="mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-2">{x.files?.map(f=><a className="btn-secondary" href={f.url} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" key={f.url}>View {f.fileName}</a>)}{x.status==="SUBMITTED"&&<><button className="btn-primary" onClick={()=>update(x.id,"ACCEPTED")}>Accept</button><button className="btn-secondary" onClick={()=>update(x.id,"REJECTED")}>Reject</button></>}{x.status==="ACCEPTED"&&<button className="btn-primary" onClick={()=>update(x.id,"PRINTING")}>Start printing</button>}{x.status==="PRINTING"&&<button className="btn-primary" onClick={()=>update(x.id,x.fulfilmentType==="HOME_DELIVERY"?"OUT_FOR_DELIVERY":"READY_FOR_PICKUP")}>Mark ready</button>}</div></div>)}</div></div>}
